  :adr/decision-summary "{:question \"how does an application on a 6399 job board become a 7810 candidacy\", :rule \"human-carried referral draft, never a cross-actor invocation: 6399 may (future) draft :application/refer records (posting-id + publication-number + applicant contact REFERENCE + consent flag, no PII payload); a human agency operator carries it into 7810 :candidacy/intake where 7810's own governor takes over\", :rationale [\"two governance domains with different risk profiles (public-content law vs placement law + candidate PII) must not fuse\" \"each actor's ledger records its own half; end-to-end story deliberately requires both\" \"no shared store, no shared governor, no API call; a live integration needs a new ADR naming transport + PII-minimization contract\"], :precedent \"ADR-2607111000 cloud-mamori (referral drafts toward governed actors, hand-carried)\", :implementation :deferred}"
